	"Derivative Dancer|was caught taking a ride around and around on the ceiling fan."
	"Exceptional Escapee|went missing for %(RAND(6) + 2) days, only to be found under a bush on the outskirts of %(snailcity)."
	"Fortified Fungus|was giving off some kind of weird spores at the last awards ceremony."
	"Grandmaster Gastropod|took a vacation and rented a whole private beach just for itself for the day."
