	"Impressive Idol|has a big scrapbook full of pictures of other racers with handwritten notes about each one."
	"Junior Jester|put on a show at a children's birthday party."
	"Kiwi Kid|got a pet bird to keep it company."
	"Loser Lemon|took a month off to snooze on the couch and watch TV."
	"Meaty Mollusk|saw itself in the mirror and was so startled that it ran and hid under the dresser for %(RAND(22) + 2) hours."
	"Nervous Newbie|was caught throwing up during training."
	"Outcast Old One|was seen at the grocery store looking at %(beans)."
	"Pickled Pasta|smells like sourdough."
