	"The Tank|has a fish tank in its room, and the fish swimming around soothes it to sleep."
	"Unbelievable Underdog|was caught taking kibble from an unknown puppy's food bowl."
	"Violin Vibrato|went on a huge shopping spree and will be changing up its look big time in its next race."
	"Walkathon Winner|started JOGGING in its free time, can you believe it!?"
