	"Znail Zone|had a bad case of the hiccups that lasted for %(RAND(6) + 2) hours."
	"DNF|\c[char,1]'s managed to scrape together enough lettuce to buy yet another rocket to strap to its shell." //The tag here introduces a teeny hiccup in the timing but i think it's ok because this change helps it feel more varied...
