insidescoop
{
	"Amazing Acorn|Amazing Acorn LOVES cheesy sitcoms. Sits and watches them all day on its days off. Laughs at every corny joke.\n\n Apparently it tapes them all throughout the week, then watches the whole week's worth of episodes in one sitting on the weekends."
	//"Burnout Bandit|"
	//"Crunching Calcium|"
	_wildstory = wildstory
	"Derivative Dancer|all the buzz about Derivative Dancer %(_wildstory[1,'|'])? It's totally fake. SOMEONE, not naming any names, found out that %(_wildstory[0,'|']), and then that story passed from snail to snail to snail to snail until it was completely unrecognizable and caused a huge scandal."
	//"Exceptional Escapee|"
	//"Fortified Fungus|"
	"Grandmaster Gastropod|has a whole team of snails that it's training personally. Cool, huh?\n\n I've thought about asking if it'll teach me too, but uh, apparently there are a lot of knives and other pointy things involved, and I think maybe it would be better for me to just train on my own, honestly." //How much we wanna bet that grandmaster gastropod is a slug tho........
	//"Hungry Hungry Hangnail|"
	"Impressive Idol|it wasn't born in the snail farms, it was hand raised by its sponsor and that's why it has the accent."
	"Junior Jester|we were all wrong about Junior Jester's recent race absence, it wasn't anything to do with a racing injury. It actually just got lost in its sponsor's %(airducts), and nobody could find it for like a week.\n\n They did eventually find it, it's fine now. But I heard its sponsor is working on drawing up a map for it to keep in its shell in case it gets lost again."
	//"Kiwi Kid|"
	"Loser Lemon|the recent epidemic of vandalized orchards wasn't the fault of Loser Lemon, but actually an overenthusiastic fan."
	//"Meaty Mollusk|"
	"Nervous Newbie|Nervous Newbie's fascination with carrots? Completely true, but not for the reason you think. Most snails enjoy them for their flavor and crunch, but Nervous Newbie? Completely. Obsessed. With the color orange.\n\n Carrots, pumpkins, apricots, cantaloupe, bell peppers, squash; you name it, Nervous Newbie eats it by the bushel.\n\n Honestly, I'm kinda jealous. I wish I was into something like that."
	//"Outcast Old One|"
	"Pickled Pasta|it originally had a different racer name, but once it started gaining notoriety it managed to pester some official into granting it a name change, and thus became the Pickled Pasta we know and love today.\n\n Its original name? I won't tell... yet."
	//"Quitter Quiz|"
	//"Relatable Racer|"
	"Snailstopher Snailerton|all those stories about Snailstopher Snailerton going bankrupt? COMPLETELY wrong, it's just been investing heavily in cabbage while the market looks good." //mhm mhm i'll bet the market looks good to a snail
	"The Tank|The Tank is actually really good at gymnastics. It was going to compete in the snailympics, but then its racing career really took off, so it gave it up to focus on the leaderboards instead.\n\n Makes you wonder what could have been, doesn't it?"
	//"Unbelievable Underdog|"
	//"Violin Vibrato|"
	//"Walkathon Winner|"
	"Xtremely Xtreme|this whole time, Xtremely Xtreme has been training on the side for shell lifting competitions, and is hoping to take the championship within the next year or so."
	//"Yes Yes Yes Yahoo!|"
	//"Znail Zone|"
	"DNF|DNF wants to be fastest AND coolest snail ever, and it refuses to compromise on anything. So it's tweaking parameters until it can achieve the perfect race.\n\n Top speed, dark glasses, facing backwards; all as part of a perfect run with no crashing.\n\n When it finally happens it's gonna be a sight to see."
	"Chaos Speedster|recent fireworks factory explosion was misattributed to Chaos Speedster. Inside sources say Yes Yes Yes Yahoo!\_w[0] became too excited during a tour of the facilities and caused a chain reaction that resulted in the impromptu light show."
	//"Eat My Dust|"
	"Super Snail|the papers printed a false story: Super Snail didn't actually save 1000 people from a burning building, it only saved 100.\n\n I mean it's more than I've ever saved but technical accuracy is important."
}

