reputationfor
{
	//"Amazing Acorn||"
	//"Burnout Bandit||"
	"Crunching Calcium|being a nutrient fiend|It carefully calculates the precise amount of nutrients in everything it eats, to achieve an optimal balance and improve its performance on the racetrack.\n\n Getting an edge on its competitors through a rigorous diet, it's honestly impressive."
	//"Derivative Dancer||"
	"Exceptional Escapee|making a beeline for the first door it sees|It must be claustrophobic because no matter where its sponsor takes it, it tries to get out. Never manages to get far, though."
	//"Fortified Fungus||"
	"Grandmaster Gastropod|being the quiet, intimidating type|Word is that Grandmaster Gastropod may or may not be orchestrating... something. Anyone who digs into it seems to get sick or go mysteriously missing, unsure why. Kinda annoying if you ask me."
	//"Hungry Hungry Hangnail||"
	"Impressive Idol|being out of touch|It was raised largely outside of snail society and can't relate to farm-raised snails or the experience of snail school, so it feels like an alien."
	//"Junior Jester||"
	//"Kiwi Kid||"
	"Loser Lemon|slacking off|Loser Lemon NEVER practices for races, it wins through raw talent alone.\n\n Shocking, right? Maybe a little disheartening for some snails, too. To think that no matter how hard you work, Loser Lemon can beat you and hardly have to lift a tentacle to do it."
	"Meaty Mollusk|only eating salads|There was an... 'incident' during snail school. It's been scarred for life since that day.\n\n It used to be best friends with Snailstopher Snailerton during snail school, if you can believe it. But they apparently went their separate ways after what happened.\n\n Anyway, I won't say too much. If you know you know."
	//"Nervous Newbie||"
	//"Outcast Old One||"
	"Pickled Pasta|enjoying weird food combinations|It's been building up a catalog of flavorful recipes for snails with various food allergies.\n\n Whether those recipes are any better than the traditional substitutes... well, reports are mixed. I'm told that they are indeed packed with intense flavor, but they tend to be an acquired taste."
	//"Quitter Quiz||"
	"Relatable Racer|being the most relatable racer ever|Relatable Racer goes out of its way to be an inspiration to ordinary snails everywhere, and show them that they, too, can achieve greatness."
	"Snailstopher Snailerton|trying to get into human jobs|It really wants to separate from snail society completely and be a white collar worker with a cubicle and a desk of its own.\n\n It's true, I found doodles of it around a water cooler with human coworkers, and other doodles of its ideal desk setup."
	//"The Tank||"
	//"Unbelievable Underdog||"
	//"Violin Vibrato||"
	//"Walkathon Winner||"
	//"Xtremely Xtreme||"
	"Yes Yes Yes Yahoo!|being very excitable|It's had a passion for cheerleading since I was a baby snail, and were it not such a gifted racer, it would have pursued a career in cheerleading instead."
	//"Znail Zone||"
	"DNF|exploding in every race it's ever been in|... Well, ok, maybe it doesn't. There's not much more to say about DNF. Just know that if DNF is involved, there's bound to be an explosion, so keep your distance and enjoy the show."
	//"Chaos Speedster||"
	//"Eat My Dust||"
	"Super Snail|being super generous and giving to charity|It donates to local community projects, gives talks at snail schools, takes free snailfies with its fans, and so much more."
}

