	"I was just hanging out in the bedroom looking through the garbage can, you know, as you do"
	"So I was exploring in the bathroom cabinets in the middle of the night when I wouldn't bother anyone"
	"So I was going through the laundry basket to make sure there was nothing left in any pockets that might get ruined in the wash"
	"So I was having a look in the refrigerator, debating having a midnight snack to keep my energy up"
	"So I was checking out all the gear in the garage, taking pictures so I could make a nice catalogue for future reference"
	"So I was making a map of the back porch, and all the possible paths to reach the windows and door as well as various hiding spots"
	"So I was scoping out the dining room from a nice vantage point on the ceiling fan"
	"So I was moseying my way through the pantry, taking stock of all the canned goods"
}

showeditcharts
{
	"showed it the charts I had printed out comparing its wins and losses to various brand endorsements it's done over time"
	"showed it my collection of tickets to all its previous races, ordered by date, and asked it to sign each one"
	"gave it my homemade satchel with hand-stitched designs of its various color schemes over the years"
	"showed it the graphs I made of how its sleep quality varied based on the temperature of its room and the foods it ate for dinner over the last year, and gave it some tips on how it could get a good night's sleep more consistently"
	"gave it some copies of the cute pictures I got of it hanging out with its sponsor, so that it can cherish those memories forever" //COPIES, not ORIGINALS, the ORIGINALS are for its COLLECTION.......... not weird at all
	"gave it a brand new copy I had made of the key to its front door, since I knew it had lost its key a few days prior"
	"gave it a portrait of itself posing with me that I made out of %(dryerlint)"
	"told it my entire life's story and how I've been following it since I was a baby snail. At some point I realized the rest of the line behind me had dispersed for some reason. Anyway"
}

dryerlint
{
	"dryer lint"
	"empty straw wrappers"
	"old receipts from the grocery store"
}



//but I want to take this time to remind everyone about the (charityevent1)
charityevent1 : array
{
	"ongoing Super Snailathon, where 100% of all proceeds from Super Snail merch go to the Safe Snail Society!\n\n Get yourself some Super Snail t-shirts, hats, mugs, posters, sponges, bags, and more, and it all goes to a great cause! Isn't that worth putting your money towards?\n\n But that's not all, use our special key word of the day, ""%(TodaysChoice(MusicStationKeyword))"", at checkout, and we'll match your donation leaf for leaf! That's right, every head you spend is DOUBLED, so get out there and make an impact!"
	"current donation drive, going towards the Racer Retirement Fund. There are so many racers out there that never had the chance to make it big while they were still in their prime, and who's going to take care of them now that they can't bring in the lettuce like they used to? YOU'RE gonna take care of them!\n\n Every leaf of lettuce you donate will go towards planting new lettuce fields to feed these snails during their golden years. Isn't that a great cause? YOU can make a direct impact in the lives of so many snails!\n\n We need just %(RAND(10) + 5) more monthly donors this hour to hit our target. You could be one of them that pushes us to that goal! Just call in and we'll sign you up, it'll only take a minute of your time. You can also sign up on the snailernet. If you can spare just a little lettuce each month, you can make a real difference in the lives of so many!"
	"merch sale we have upcoming! All your favorite Mollusk Music merch will be going on sale, with some items as much as 60% off!\n\n T-shirts, hats, mugs, plushies, bookmarks, and so much more. Get your lettuce ready and pick out some designs you like so you can order them before we run out of stock!\n\n Got a loved one with a birthday coming up? Mollusk Music merch makes for great gifts that anyone will love!" //TODO maybe make 60% be a randomly rolled number
	"new single by Diamond DJ dropping tomorrow! Ooh, it's so exciting, isn't it?\n\n We'll be debuting it here on Mollusk Music, so if you want to be among the first to listen%(emdash)and who wouldn't%(emdash)be sure to tune in to 103.7 bright and early!"
	"Q&A that we'll be having with Diamond DJ next week. Got a question for everyone's favorite singing snail? Get it in now! Send your questions in on the snailernet or via our app, and we'll pick the best ones to ask it live on air!\n\n Anything you wanna know! %(Capitalize(qa.music)), %(qa.snail), %(qa.silly('you'))? Ask it, and we'll try to get you answers!"
	"interview we're going to be having with %(TodaysChoice(FamousSnails)) in a few days! Send us your questions, and we might just ask them live on the show!\n\n Want to know %(qa.racer), %(qa.snail), or %(qa.silly('you'))? Go submit your questions via the snailernet or our app, and vote on the questions that have already been proposed! We'll be asking the most popular questions we get that haven't already been answered!"
	"donation drive for shell repairs being provided by %(TodaysChoice(snailcity)) Hospital. That's right, %(TodaysChoice(snailcity)) Hospital is going to be providing shell repair services to so many snails for FREE, but they can only provide that service if they get sufficient funding!\n\n Just imagine how many little snails there are out there with damaged shells that can't race, and how happy you could make them by donating a little lettuce towards the cause. You could make a real impact in a snail's life!\n\n Sign up today to make a donation, or better yet, pledge a monthly amount and make an ongoing impact with just a little lettuce each month! Signing up is easy, it only takes a moment, and you can do it in whatever way is most convenient for you. Give us a call, go to our website on the snailernet, sign up through our app%(emdash)heck, if you live in %(TodaysChoice(snailcity)) I'm sure they'd be happy to sign you up in person if you walked into the hospital.\n\n It's a great cause, so if you can give, please do! And if you sign up any time this week, we'll even send you an exclusive donor patch to celebrate your generosity."
	"upcoming anniversary for one of our local brands, %(brandanniversary)! That's right, %(brandanniversary) is going to be celebrating its anniversary soon, and I hear there's going to be %(TodaysChoice(brandanniversarydeal)) to celebrate!\n\n Sounds fun, right!? I, for one, can't wait to see what they're cooking up! And I hope you'll join us to celebrate the day."
	"Mollusk Music meetup that we have coming up next month! If you want to meet up and see us doing the show in person, and meet other fans of the station, sign up on the snailernet or go through our app to sign up!\n\n We're gonna have food, prizes to win, and so much more. I can't wait to see all our lovely fans out there, snails and sponsors alike!"
	"big meet-and-greet event we're doing with %(TodaysChoice(FamousSnails)) next week! That's right, it's your chance to get to meet %(TodaysChoice(FamousSnails)) in person, and if you bring your favorite merch, you might just be able to get it signed!\n\n Sign ups are on our website or our app, make sure to get your name on the list quick before slots fill up! And remember, only 2 pieces of merch per person for the signing, so that everyone has a chance! And if you don't have anything to be signed, we'll be selling %(TodaysChoice(FamousSnails)) merch at the event!"
	//"upcoming charity event"
	//donation drive
	//merch sale
	//local brand anniversary
	//radio meetup
	//etc...
}

//it's that part of the hour where I remind you guys about the (charityevent2)
charityevent2 : array
{
	"Super Snailathon that's going on. 100% of all proceeds from Super Snail merch go straight to the %(TodaysChoice(safesnailsociety)), so you can get yourself some cool merch of your favorite Super Snail and give to a good cause at the same time!\n\n Not only that, but if you use our special key word today, ""%(TodaysChoice(MusicStationKeyword))"", we'll make a donation matching the amount you spent, leaf for leaf! The impact from your choice will be DOUBLED, isn't that cool?\n\n So don't put it off, get out there and get yourself some Super Snail merch, and celebrate the %(TodaysChoice(safesnailsociety)) with us!"
	"donation drive going on today, benefitting the Racer Retirement Fund. Every leaf you can donate goes to planting new lettuce fields for aging racers who never made it big and need a little help in their golden years. Isn't that a cause worth putting your lettuce towards?\n\n We're looking to get %(RAND(10) + 5) new monthly donors this hour, but of course, one-off donations are welcome too! Anything we can do to help some cute little snails out, am I right? Just call in and we'll help you sign up, it'll only take a few moments of your time. You can also sign up on the snailernet, we've had %(RAND(10) + 3) donors sign up that way already, and the feedback has been awesome!"
	"big Mollusk Music merch sale we have coming up! T-shirts, hoodies, sling bags, sunglasses, patches; there's so much to love, and you can get it up to 60% off in just a few days!\n\n Now is the time to pick out what you like, and be prepared to order it quickly when the sale starts, before your favorites sell out!\n\n Already have plenty of Mollusk Music merch for yourself? Why not order some for friends and family so they can show off their favorite radio station too!"
	"new single by Diamond DJ that's debuting here on Mollusk Music tomorrow! That's right, if you want to be one of the first to listen to the new tune, you've got to tune in to 103.7 to hear it live as it releases to the public!\n\n I've gotta tell you folks, we have a little sample of what's coming tomorrow, and I've been listening to it over and over again. You gotta get excited for this one, it's going to be a hit for sure. But don't just take my word for it! That's right, strap in because we're about to play that sample for you right now so you can get excited with us! Let's hear it!\n\n %(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)\n\n \f[italic,1]%(TodaysChoice(diamonddjsong))\f[italic,default]\n\n %(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)"
	"Q&A that we're going to be having with Diamond DJ next week! If you want the inside scoop, now's the time to ask your questions. That's right, we'll be asking YOUR questions and getting real answers!\n\n Send in your questions on the snailernet or on our app, and we'll pick the best ones to inquire about during our session! I've seen several folks asking %(qa.silly), so I'm sure that'll be on our list. If you have another burning question that you just gotta know the answer to, be sure to send it our way!"
	"interview coming up with %(TodaysChoice(FamousSnails)) in just a few days! We've got all sorts of questions to ask, it turns out lots of folks want to know %(qa.silly)!\n\n If that's something you want to ask as well, make sure to find us on the snailernet or check out our app, and vote for your favorite questions or submit your own!"
	"donation drive this week for %(TodaysChoice(snailcity)) Hospital. They're going to be launching a FREE shell repair service for any snail in need, and they need funding!\n\n If you can spare a little lettuce, please send it their way. Just think of how many little snails there are out there with damaged shells, and you could make a big impact in their lives by helping to provide them with repair services. Isn't that a cause worth donating to?\n\n Signing up is so easy you guys, just call in and we'll set you up, or find us on the snailernet or go on our app. Whatever way you choose, it'll only take a few minutes of your time, and ANY amount of lettuce makes a real difference.\n\n Sign up this week and we'll even send you one of these special donor patches to celebrate your generosity! You can't see these on the radio, but they're SO cute, you definitely want to get one while they're available. So go sign up and give!"
	"big anniversary that %(brandanniversary) is going to be celebrating soon! Yep, you heard that right, %(brandanniversary) is going to be having an anniversary, and I'm told there'll be %(TodaysChoice(brandanniversarydeal)) to celebrate!\n\n It's been a great year for %(brandanniversary), and they're such good friends of the show that we've just gotta celebrate this great achievement with them. Another year going strong, serving snails everywhere. Wow.\n\n Look forward to the festivities coming up, I know I am!"
	"Mollusk Music meetup happening just a month from today! All our fans our welcome, snails and sponsors alike. We're gonna be doing the show outdoors, with lots of food provided, prizes to win, and so much more.\n\n Sign up on the snailernet or through our app, and come and join us in a celebration of radio and snail music!"
	"upcoming %(TodaysChoice(FamousSnails)) meet-and-greet event we're doing next week! Sign up before slots are full, and you can bring up to 2 pieces of merchandise to be signed! We'll also be selling merch at the event, so if you don't have anything to be signed, you can get something while you're there.\n\n There'll be food and drink too, so you can make a day of it and meet lots of other %(TodaysChoice(FamousSnails)) fans!"
}

//Hey hey hey, check it out guys, we've still got that (charityevent3)
charityevent3 : array
{
	"Super Snailathon going on! It's a great time to order yourself some Super Snail merch. Y'know why?\n\n Ding ding ding, that's right! 100% of all proceeds from merch sold today are going to support the %(TodaysChoice(safesnailsociety)), so get out there and spend your lettuce for a great cause!\n\n Not only that, if you use our key word of the day, ""%(TodaysChoice(MusicStationKeyword))"", we'll donate and match your contribution! That's right, we're DOUBLING your impact, leaf for leaf! So get out there and get yourself something fun! T-shirts, hats, mugs, posters, sponges, bags, and so much more. It can be yours today, and you can feel great about supporting an awesome cause!"
	"donation drive for the Racer Retirement Fund going! We just need a few more monthly donors to sign up in order to hit our goal for this hour, we're almost there!\n\n Every leaf you donate goes towards planting brand new lettuce fields that are being set up to feed older snails that never made it big in their prime and could use a stable source of lettuce in their later years. It's a good cause, right? Of course it is!\n\n Signing up is easy, just give us a call or visit us on the snailernet. It'll only take a few minutes of your time, and you can feel good about giving just a few leaves each month, knowing you're helping so many snails in need. All of our lettuce donors are amazing, a big thank you to everyone who's donated or pledged a monthly donation so far!"
	"merch sale upcoming, and I can see that a lot of people are adding our latest t-shirt and hoodie designs to their wishlists. Did you know we also have those designs on tanktops, shorts, and socks? If you're itching to have it but the t-shirts and hoodies get sold out before you can snag one, there are other ways to have it that are just as comfortable and nice to wear!\n\n You can also get our commemorative glasses, picture frames, wallets, and so much more! There's a lot to explore on the store, guys, and lots of great gift ideas for your friends and family!"
	"the upcoming Diamond DJ single to get excited about! It's dropping tomorrow and it's one of the most highly anticipated releases this year. I can practically feel everyone holding their breath to see what Diamond DJ's cooked up for us this time!\n\n Want to hear a little sample? We'll be debuting the song tomorrow, but until then, here's a little appetizer to get you excited to tune in!\n\n %(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)\n\n \f[italic,1]%(TodaysChoice(diamonddjsong))\f[italic,default]\n\n %(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)%(note1)"
	"Q&A with Diamond DJ coming up next week, so make sure that you get your questions in! Want to know %(qa.music), or maybe %(qa.snail)? That's right, if you've got something you've been wondering about, now's your chance to find out because we'll be asking YOUR most burning questions live on the show!\n\n I've seen a lot of folks asking about %(qa.silly), so I'm sure it'll be a fun show whether we get to ask your particular question or not!"
	"interview with %(TodaysChoice(FamousSnails)) on the horizon, there's just a few more days left to submit your questions and vote on your favorites. We'll be asking the most popular questions live on the air!\n\n It looks like the question that's in the lead right now is %(qa.silly)! Wow, \f[italic,1]tens of thousands\f[italic,default] of you really want to know, hahaha! If you're wondering the same thing, make sure you visit the voting page on the snailernet, or right in our app where you can cast votes and submit questions of your own!"
	"donation drive for %(TodaysChoice(snailcity)) Hospital going on all week! That's right, %(TodaysChoice(snailcity)) Hospital is going to be launching a shell repair service, and they want it to be absolutely FREE for any snails in need. Isn't that great!?\n\n You can make a real impact in the lives of so many snails in %(TodaysChoice(snailcity)) if you sign up to give TODAY. Any amount is appreciated, but of course, if you can spare a little lettuce each month that'll make the biggest impact!\n\n Signing up is super easy too. You can call us, go on the snailernet, use our app; whatever way you wanna do it, it only takes a few minutes, and you can make so many little snails happy. And if you sign up during this donation drive, we'll even send you one of these cute little patches we had made exclusively for this event! So get out there and be generous, the snails of %(TodaysChoice(snailcity)) need you!"
	"anniversary for one of our local brands, %(brandanniversary), coming up very soon! We're gonna be having a party here in the studio to celebrate, and we hope you'll join the festivities at home. I'm told there'll also be %(TodaysChoice(brandanniversarydeal)), so get excited for that! I know I am!\n\n It's really great to see a local business doing well, isn't it? And they're such great friends of the show, too. Talk about authentic business owners with an authentic product!"
	"Mollusk Music meetup happening just a month from today, sign up while there are still slots available! We're gonna be doing the show surrounded by fans and plenty of food to go around, as well as prize drawings and some other fun stuff we've got planned!\n\n Come and see us in person, and meet snail music fans from all over!"
	"meet-and-greet event with %(TodaysChoice(FamousSnails)) coming up next week, where there will be food and signings and more! If you haven't got anything to be signed, we'll be selling merch there at the event so you don't have to leave empty-handed!\n\n Sign up now to meet one of the greats in person!"
}

